title: Building Energy Conditional Flow Matching - Six-Cohort Reliability Study
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: Md. Mahbubur
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0252-9140

repository-code: https://github.com/mahbubur2008018/building-energy-cfm-reliability

abstract: >-
  Source code, protocol locks, and verified aggregate results for a six-cohort
  probabilistic building energy estimation study using Conditional Flow Matching.
  Evaluates CFM and distributional baselines across Drammen COFACTOR, EDCS, Miami,
  BDG2, and Oslo COFACTOR-SBHUB datasets. Includes Drammen-to-Oslo transfer experiment.
  Targets Building Services Engineering Research and Technology (BSER&T).

keywords:
  - building energy estimation
  - conditional flow matching
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - conformal prediction
  - CatBoost
  - NGBoost
  - building services engineering

